    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2055714944331481099",
      "url": "https://x.com/Maidatacrypto/status/2055714944331481099",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/Maidatacrypto/status/2055714944331481099",
      "text": "there's a system that has been running for decades and it was never designed with you in mind\n\nlet me explain that to you \n\nwhen the wealthy want to grow their money\nthey don't just put it in a savings account and hope they call a private wealth manager\n\nthey get access to curated strategies, compounding yields, structured portfolios\nthe kind of returns that turn money into generational wealth\n\nbut when you try to access that same system? minimum deposit: $100,000\ndon't have it?\nthe door stays closed\n\nand that's not an accident\nthe traditional financial system was built to serve those who already have\nnot those who are trying to build\n\na kid in lagos, a nurse in manila, a freelancer in cairo they all play by different rules\nnot because they're less capable\nbut because the system decided they were less worthy\n\nthat used to make me angry\nnow it just makes me want to show people the alternative\n\nbecause here's what changed\nblockchain didn't just create new currencies\nit created new infrastructure\n\ninfrastructure that doesn't ask for your net worth before letting you in\ninfrastructure that doesn't care about your zip code, your passport, or your bank balance\n\nand @blok_cap is one of the most serious projects i've seen building on that infrastructure\n\n𝗕𝗟𝗢𝗞 𝗖𝗮𝗽𝗶𝘁𝗮𝗹 is a decentralized wealth management protocol\nmeaning the same strategies that hedge funds and high net worth individuals use to compound their wealth\nare now accessible to anyone with a wallet\n\nlet that sit for a second\nnot anyone with $100,000\nnot anyone with the right connections\nanyone with a wallet 💪\n\nhere's what makes it different from everything else out there\nevery strategy on the protocol is published and readable before you commit a single dollar\nfees are enforced by smart contract the manager earns only when you earn\n\nyou can exit anytime, one transaction, funds back in your wallet immediately\nno gatekeeping. no paperwork. no permission\n\ni've been in this space long enough to know the difference between projects that talk about inclusion\nand projects that actually engineer it into their architecture\n\n𝗕𝗟𝗢𝗞 𝗖𝗮𝗽𝗶𝘁𝗮𝗹 is the second kind\n\nthe global wealth management industry controls over $100 trillion\nfor decades it decided who deserved a seat at the table\n\nthat era is ending\nand the people who recognize it early\nare the ones who will look back and say they were there when it changed\n\ni'm already there\nand if any of this resonates with you\nyou should be too\n\nfollow @blok_cap and connect to all it's social handles explore the ecosystem very well and position yourself.\n\nwebsite: https://t.co/ZcxTwoDgks\nEveryone Deserves a Garden 🌱",
